{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gate_hardwood","model_identifier":"gate_hardwood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# gate_hardwood\n\nHardwood gate, twice as wide in Patch 5: six columns (96 u) along X. Dark log posts with iron bands, caps and spikes, a heavy two-log lintel with iron straps and a crenellated top, and two plank leaves with iron bands, studs, ring handles, hinge straps and a drop-bar bracket. Opening 72 u wide x 90 u tall. Leaves hinged at the jambs (`leaf_l` at x -37, `leaf_r` at x +37) open inward (+Z). Clips `open` and `close`.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 1 columns (96 x 16 units, 2.70 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -48..49, y -3..131, z -8..6 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 129, construction_0 28, construction_33 64, construction_66 105, ruined 55 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `gate_hardwood_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- jambs: two 12 x 131 x 16 boxes at x -42 / +42\n- leaves (when closed): 72 x 92 x 4 at the origin; open leaves do not block\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `open` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing about 95 degrees inward (+Z) and hold open. |\n| `close` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing shut and hold. |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -16)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"log_post_l_f0#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48,-2,-6],"to":[-41.9,118,-1],"autouv":0,"color":1,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[88,0,94,120],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[112,0,117,120],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[94,0,100,120],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[117,0,122,120],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[136,164,142,169],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[142,164,148,169],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7419fde3-31ec-ada5-c369-22ac246bc24f"},{"name":"iron_cap_l_f0","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.3,117.5,-6.3],"to":[-41.6,120,-0.7],"autouv":0,"color":8,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[158,177,165,180],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[270,177,276,180],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[165,177,172,180],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[276,177,282,180],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[296,151,303,157],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[303,151,310,157],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a17505e0-d808-6595-971c-c33d133f3f82"},{"name":"iron_spike_l_f0","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-45.95,119.5,-4.5],"to":[-43.95,125,-2.5],"autouv":0,"color":6,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[352,151,354,157],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[354,151,356,157],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[356,151,358,157],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[358,151,360,157],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[414,181,416,183],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[416,181,418,183],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7d5efdfe-7da2-2327-b83e-19d38c1c2e82"},{"name":"log_post_l_b0#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48,-1,0],"to":[-41.9,122,5